# Hero illustration prompt

Generated with the built-in image generation tool.

> Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: full-bleed desktop website hero illustration for a software developer portfolio. Scene: an original, atmospheric moonlit coastal observatory landscape at blue hour, a small modern observatory and distant city lights on the right side, luminous cloud layers and a few delicate star-like light points suggesting curiosity and technology without literal computer symbols. Style: painterly digital illustration with visible soft brush texture, cinematic depth, editorial and literary mood, sophisticated rather than fantasy. Composition: wide 16:9 landscape; leave the lower-left and central-left areas calm and darker with minimal detail so a translucent text card can overlay legibly; visual focal point toward the right. Palette: deep midnight blue #003159, electric sky blue #3598ff used sparingly for moonlight and distant lights, cool near-white #ededed highlights. No typography, no logos, no UI, no code glyphs, no turquoise, no warm orange, no stock-photo look, no abstract 3D, no watermark.
</file>

<file path="src/assets/hero-smoke.prompt.md">
# Hero smoke background

Generated with OpenAI image generation for the portfolio home section.

Prompt: Create an original full-bleed website hero background image, wide landscape 16:9. Visual concept: flowing smoke or colored ink dispersing underwater, inspired by editorial portfolio art direction. Deep midnight navy (#003159) and near-black blue background. Large, luminous semi-transparent ribbons and plumes of cool electric sky blue (#3598ff), soft icy blue, and a little cool white (#ededed) curl and billow across the frame, especially upper left, center, and right. Intricate silky wisps, soft volumetric folds, organic fluid motion, elegant cinematic lighting, rich depth, subtle fine grain. Composition must work behind a glass text card in the lower-left: keep that region darker and quieter, while creating a memorable flowing form visible above and around it. Retain dark negative space for UI legibility. Photographic/abstract artwork quality, sophisticated and restrained, no hard geometry. Do not include any text, logos, letters, people, landscape, buildings, observatory, stars, planets, nebula, icons, mockup UI, borders, or watermark. The image should feel like suspended smoke in liquid, not outer space. Opaque background.
